        <summary>
          <para>Mute vibration and sound from ringtones, alarms or notifications while this camera device is in use.</para>
          <para>As of API level 37, this option will also turn off any lights on the device if they are bright enough to interfere with camera photos or recordings.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraDevice#AUDIO_RESTRICTION_VIBRATION_SOUND" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraDevice.AUDIO_RESTRICTION_VIBRATION_SOUND</code>.</a></format></para>
